{"t":"Mystery of the Valley Quest/Spoiler","s":"mystery-of-the-valley-quest-spoiler-f6d70","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(250 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">14.12.969405<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">February 4, 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<ul><li>First piece: <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a> - <a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a></li>\n<li>Second piece: <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a> - <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a></li>\n<li>Third piece: <a href=\"#/wiki/Kilmaresh\">Kilmaresh</a> - <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel\">Kha'zeel</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Winter%20Wolf\">Winter Wolf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Polar%20Bear\">Polar Bear</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Tribewarden\">Chakoya Tribewarden</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Toolshaper\">Chakoya Toolshaper</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Windcaller\">Chakoya Windcaller</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Legionnaire\">Lizard Legionnaire</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Dragon%20Priest\">Lizard Dragon Priest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20High%20Guard\">Lizard High Guard</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess%20of%20the%20Wild%20Sun\">Priestess of the Wild Sun</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Sphinx%20Acolyte\">Black Sphinx Acolyte</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Burning%20Gladiator\">Burning Gladiator</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Elemental\">Energy Elemental</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Energy%20Elemental\">Massive Energy Elemental</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no reward.</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completed up to <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">Cure the Dogs</a> mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a> to access <a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a>;</li>\n<li>2x <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Hams</a> (access to <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimlund\">Grimlund</a> area in <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a> via sled);</li>\n<li>Completed up to <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">An Offer You Can't Refuse</a> mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a> to access <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a>;</li>\n<li><i>Optional:</i> access to <a href=\"#/wiki/Azzilon%20Castle\">Azzilon Castle</a> (check <a href=\"#/quest/no-rest-for-the-wicked-quest\">No Rest for the Wicked Quest</a>).\n<ul><li><small>It is possible to proceed in this quest without going to Azzilon and speaking to <a href=\"#/wiki/Lai\">Lai</a>.</small></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Mystery_of_the_Valley\">Mystery of the Valley</span></h2>\n<p>Travel to <a href=\"#/wiki/Azzilon%20Castle\">Azzilon Castle</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and meet with <a href=\"#/wiki/Lai\">Lai</a>. Ask her about <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">statue</span> and she will tell you about an ancient secret related to Merudri civilization and a mysterious valley. She tells you the valley was once forbidden to outsiders, and about a legend on a trespassing adventurer who saw a Merudri pilgrim using a statue with three dragons holding a crystal to travel back to the valley.\n</p><p>Find the three fragments and assemble the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Guardian%20Statue%20%28Quest%29\"><img alt=\"Guardian Statue (Quest)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Guardian_Statue_Quest_4b90d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Guardian%20Statue%20%28Quest%29\">Guardian Statue (Quest)</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Fragment\">First Fragment</span></h3>\n<div style=\"float:right;\"><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -98px;left:-1300px;clip:rect(98px 1556px 354px 1300px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32458,31089,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32458, 31089, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>Head to <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a> and use the sled (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32367,31058,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32367, 31058, 7)</a>) to access the east part of the island, <a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a>. You need to have <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Hams</a> in your backpack to go to and from this area, so it is recommended to have at least two with you.\n</p><p>Walk a bit more east and <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">levitate</a> up this mountain (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32458,31089,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32458, 31089, 7)</a>) twice. At the top, use the shrine and you will find the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fragment%20of%20a%20Statue%20%281st%29\"><img alt=\"Fragment_of_a_Statue_(1st)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fragment_of_a_Statue_1st_cbaa54.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fragment%20of%20a%20Statue%20%281st%29\">first fragment of a statue</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"337ec91abe23500740fedbb7b8f099ce\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Mystery_of_the_Valley_-_First_Fragment-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Finding the first fragment.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Finding the first fragment.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mystery_of_the_Valley_First_Fragment_dc207a.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Mystery of the Valley - First Fragment.png (324 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Finding the first fragment.</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Fragment\">Second Fragment</span></h3>\n<div style=\"float:right;\"><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -288px;left:-2780px;clip:rect(288px 3036px 544px 2780px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33198,31184,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33198, 31184, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Lai\">Lai</a> tells you the second shrine is in an area with lots of green, insects buzzing, heat shimmering, bamboo trees, and grass. Head to <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a> and go up the stairs <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33198,31184,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33198, 31184, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>Use the shrine and you will find the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fragment%20of%20a%20Statue%20%282nd%29\"><img alt=\"Fragment_of_a_Statue_(2nd)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fragment_of_a_Statue_2nd_c55874.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fragment%20of%20a%20Statue%20%282nd%29\">second fragment of a statue</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"9360789094aa5c5af45df2c9c454bcda\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Mystery_of_the_Valley_-_Second_Fragment-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Finding the second fragment.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Finding the second fragment.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mystery_of_the_Valley_Second_Fragment_a60408.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Mystery of the Valley - Second Fragment.png (506 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Finding the second fragment.</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Third_Fragment\">Third Fragment</span></h3>\n<div style=\"float:right;\"><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1340px;left:-4060px;clip:rect(1340px 4316px 1596px 4060px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33838,31710,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33838, 31710, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Lai\">Lai</a> tells you the third shrine is in a dry area with large rocks and cliffs, where a large river flows through the land and saturates the barren landscape, and with someone walking around not far from it.\n</p><p>Head to the Southern Steppe in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kilmaresh\">Kilmaresh</a>, go up the stairs <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33838,31710,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33838, 31710, 7)</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">levitate</a> up a platform west from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Tefrit\">Tefrit</a>. Use the shrine and you will find the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fragment%20of%20a%20Statue%20%283rd%29\"><img alt=\"Fragment_of_a_Statue_(3rd)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fragment_of_a_Statue_3rd_2ef4f0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fragment%20of%20a%20Statue%20%283rd%29\">third fragment of a statue</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"2\" hash=\"17c1c12127b61b6a8e2bcbcf81e81b50\" id=\"w-gallery-2\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Mystery_of_the_Valley_-_Third_Fragment-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Finding the third fragment.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Finding the third fragment.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mystery_of_the_Valley_Third_Fragment_f9e97e.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Mystery of the Valley - Third Fragment.png (414 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Finding the third fragment.</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Crystal_Fragments\">Crystal Fragments</span></h3>\n<div style=\"float:right;\"><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -3300px;left:-2572px;clip:rect(3300px 2828px 3556px 2572px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33094,32690,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33094, 32690, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Lai\">Lai</a> congratulates you for gathering all missing pieces of the statue but tells you need a few more crystal fragments from the original statue found atop a rock in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel\">Kha'zeel</a>.\n</p><p>Head to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> desert and <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">levitate</a> up the mountains to the west where you can find some <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Elemental\">Energy Elementals</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33094,32690,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33094, 32690, 7)</a>, and then <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33082,32704,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33082, 32704, 6)</a>). Walk a bit north and levitate a last time (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33084,32669,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33084, 32669, 4)</a>).\n</p><p>Use one of the three pieces of the statue from your backpack in the crystal fragments on the floor and the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Guardian%20Statue%20%28Quest%29\"><img alt=\"Guardian Statue (Quest)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Guardian_Statue_Quest_4b90d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Guardian%20Statue%20%28Quest%29\">Guardian Statue (Quest)</a> is assembled.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"3\" hash=\"4c541e23242b03d1bf6e29fb0795dfcf\" id=\"w-gallery-3\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Mystery_of_the_Valley_-_Crystal_Fragments-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Finding crystal fragments.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Finding crystal fragments.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mystery_of_the_Valley_Crystal_Fragments_0644f7.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Mystery of the Valley - Crystal Fragments.png (451 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Finding crystal fragments.</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Mystery_of_the_Valley_2\">Mystery of the Valley</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nLai: Be greeted, seeker of knowledge!<br/>\nPlayer: statue<br/>\nLai: Who told you about this? Knowledge of the valley was secret and outside interference forbidden for centuries. ...<br/>\nLai: Not long ago, my predecessors would have brought the fiery rage of the Claw upon you...! Well, times are changing and so do we. The blue valley is the sacred home and remnant of our civilisation, the ancient Merudri, my kin. ...<br/>\nLai: In any case, you're probably not even the first outsider to learn about it. <b>Legend</b> has it among our kin that a stranger once glimpsed upon the valley when it was still forbidden for outsiders to walk Merudri soil. But I should not talk about this.<br/>\nPlayer: legend<br/>\nLai: Well, there's no harm in telling it to someone like you, I assume. So, let me tell you a story about a trespasser, a wayfaring adventurer, not unlike you. ...<br/>\nLai: The wayfarer witnessed a pilgrimaging Merudri travelling back to the valley, using one of our guardian statues. Three dragons holding a powerful crystal that mingles with time and space. ...<br/>\nLai: When he approached the crystal, another pilgrim appeared and destroyed the crystal with a mighty blow, turning to the trespasser as he picks up a piece of debris from the smashed crystal. ...<br/>\nLai: Thus, he escaped the all-seeing eyes of the valley guards. It is said that the stranger carved a wooden miniature from it, carefully modelling every minute detail and even placing a crystal fragment on top of it. ...<br/>\nLai: We do not know if this nameless wanderer ever tried to return to the valley but the power in the crystal fragment of the statue would not suffice to allow travel between any point in this world and the valley. ...<br/>\nLai: However, there was still a flicker of ancient power left in the stolen fragment. Putting the miniature together, something must have struck a terrible fear in the heart of the interloper. ...<br/>\nLai: Some say the face of a Dhar-Enpa has appeared in a facet of the crystal, others say he was struck by lightning the very moment the statue was put together. ...<br/>\nLai: However, there was still a flicker of ancient power left in the stolen fragment. Putting the miniature together, something must have struck a terrible fear in the heart of the interloper. ...<br/>\nLai: Terrified, he threw the statue away, breaking it in the process. To atone for his transgressions and not to anger the Merudri any further, he build three shrines across the world to house its fragments and honour the Merudri. ...<br/>\nLai: The guardians followed his every step since the theft of the fragment. A kind Enpa decided to leave the stranger alone and kept the whereabouts of these shrines hidden as any interference with our culture outside of the valley remained prohibited. ...<br/>\nLai: Only Enpa Udra knows the exact locations of the shrines. They are of no worth for us but we respect the remorse of the trespasser towards our people in hindsight. ...<br/>\nLai: Why are you looking at me like that? As I said, the statue doesn't have any actual purpose. Do you really want to find it?<br/>\nPlayer: yes<br/>\nLai: If you want to search for them yourself, I will have to channel Dhar-Enpa Udra, who has left his physical form a long time ago. This will take a few days, however. ...<br/>\nLai: The best way to start looking while I conduct the channelling would be to search the cold places of this world as one of the fragments is definitely hidden in the eternal ice.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/quest/mystery-of-the-valley-quest\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</a></span>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Fragment_2\">First Fragment</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: fragment of a statue <br/>\nLai: Enpa Udra tries to show me location... I cannot see clearly yet. It's all white and chaotic. The first shrine seems hidden in ice and snow, not far from a large human settlement.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/quest/mystery-of-the-valley-quest\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</a></span>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Fragment_2\">Second Fragment</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: fragment of a statue <br/>\nLai: Enpa Udra showed me the location. ...<br/>\nLai: I can clearly see the first shrine now, it's on a small cliff near the city of Svargrond. The second one however... There is heat shimmering, insects buzzing and a lot of green. Bamboo trees and grass. A different shrine sits right next to it.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/quest/mystery-of-the-valley-quest\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</a></span>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Third_Fragment_2\">Third Fragment</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: fragment of a statue <br/>\nLai: Enpa Udra showed me the location. ...<br/>\nLai: I can see two of the shrines very clearly now, the first is on a small cliff near the city of Svargrond, the second one on a small plateau in the land Zao. The third one is somewhat clear but still too hazy to make it out exactly. ...<br/>\nLai: It's a dry area and there are large rocks and cliffs. A large river flows through the land and saturates the barren landscape. Someone seems to walk around not far from it.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/quest/mystery-of-the-valley-quest\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</a></span>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Crystal_Fragments_2\">Crystal Fragments</span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Before_assembling_the_statue\">Before assembling the statue</span></h4>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: fragment of a statue <br/>\nLai: You found all three missing pieces, congratulations! To combine them, you'll need a few more crystal fragments from the original statue. Enpa Udra showed me the location where the statue once stood: atop a rock on the foot of the Kha'zeel mountains. ...<br/>\nLai: I saw cracks in the stone there, so bring a shovel or pick. If you can still find some of the fragments of the shattered crystal, you may be able to reconstruct the statue using them to mend the three pieces and the crystal.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/quest/mystery-of-the-valley-quest\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</a></span>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-After_assembling_the_statue\">After assembling the statue</span></h4>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: fragment of a statue <br/>\nLai: So, you reconstructed the guardian statue. You know, it was scattered and hidden for a reason back then. ...<br/>\nLai: Oh well, Dahr-Enpa Udra doesn't seem to mind. Maybe it is time to finally invite outsiders into the valley and Udra has seen its future. But that's certainly not for you or me to decide.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/quest/mystery-of-the-valley-quest\">Mystery of the Valley Quest</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>","quests":[]}